    "overview": "Intex SRAC123I 1 Ton Inverter Split Air Conditioner The Intex SRAC123i is a high-performance 1 Ton Inverter AC engineered for ultimate comfort and energy efficiency. Part of the Glacier series, it features 7-in-1 Convertible power modes, allowing you to customize cooling capacity based on room occupancy to save energy. Designed to tackle extreme Indian summers, it provides effective cooling even at temperatures as high as 54°C. This AC prioritizes health and maintenance with Frost Self-Clean technology, which deep cleans the indoor unit in 15-20 minutes, and a PM 2.5 filter for cleaner, healthier air. Built with a 100% Copper condenser and Blue Fin indoor protection, it ensures durability and faster heat transfer. The inclusion of a BLDC motor guarantees silent operation and low power consumption, making it a perfect blend of power and tranquility.",
